  "description": "During a rain festival in a rural village, I met a strange boy. And it rained.\n\nI forget about work on that day that was like a dream.\n\nAfter that, we lived together from the time we came down to the rural village.\n\nTo fall in love with Deokhyun and go to the same university as him\n\nPassed after struggling In winter, before turning 20, Hae-joo meets the boy again after 5 years.\n\nI realize that I can't go out of the country because of what happened five years ago.\n\nIn order to go to the city, Haeju and the boy must find the village's serpent before winter is over.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%A0%EC%94%A8%EC%9D%98-%EC%9A%94%EC%A0%95/2126), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67460620)",
